			"notes": "# Full Item Settings support!\nYou now have the full functionality as if you declared your own item from within your own mod!\n\n- Adds `minecraft:recipe_remainder` component, which tells the crafting table what item to leave behind when the item is used in as an ingredient. Takes an item stack instance."
